{% if arousalDesc == "overwhelmingly aroused" %}
({{ actorName }} is flushed and restless — shifting {{ poss }} weight, slow to meet anyone's eye.{% if isNaked == "true" %} Being unclothed leaves little of it hidden.{% endif %})

